.TH SCHED_SETPARAM 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_setparam \- sets scheduling parameters for a thread; process zero selects the caller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_setparam(pid_t process, const struct sched_param* parameter);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets scheduling parameters for a thread; process zero selects the caller.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_setparam (2)
